k rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-6.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Luqman 31:6 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"İnsanlardan kimisi bilgisizce Allah’ın yolundan saptırmak ve o ayetleri bir eğlence edinmek için boş sözleri satın alırlar. İşte onlar için aşağılayıcı bir\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/31.html\">Sûre Luqman</a> › Âyet 6</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Luqman 31:6</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَمِنَ النَّاسِ مَن يَشْتَرِي لَهْوَ الْحَدِيثِ لِيُضِلَّ عَن سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ بِغَيْرِ عِلْمٍ وَيَتَّخِذَهَا هُزُوًا أُولَٰئِكَ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ مُّهِينٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">İnsanlardan kimisi bilgisizce Allah’ın yolundan saptırmak ve o ayetleri bir eğlence edinmek için boş sözleri satın alırlar. İşte onlar için aşağılayıcı bir azap vardır.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>İmam İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim</h2><h3>Başkalarından naklettikleri</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">ابن مسعود</span> <span class=\"st\">استشهد به</span> «والله الذى لا إله غيره هو الغناء -يرددها ثلاث مرات.»<cite>«إغاثة اللهفان من مصايد الشيطان» 1/240</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s31a6\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/tr/ayah/31-15.html\">Sonraki âyet (31:15)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/31-15.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Luqman 31:15 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Eğer onlar bilmediğin şeyi bana ortak koşman için seni zorlarlarsa; sen sakın onlara itaat etme! Bununla beraber dünyada onlarla iyi geçin ve sen bana döne\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-15.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Luqman 31:15 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Eğer onlar bilmediğin şeyi bana ortak koşman için seni zorlarlarsa; sen sakın onlara itaat etme! Bununla beraber dünyada onlarla iyi geçin ve sen bana döne\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/31.html\">Sûre Luqman</a> › Âyet 15</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Luqman 31:15</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَإِن جَاهَدَاكَ عَلَىٰ أَن تُشْرِكَ بِي مَا لَيْسَ لَكَ بِهِ عِلْمٌ فَلَا تُطِعْهُمَا وَصَاحِبْهُمَا فِي الدُّنْيَا مَعْرُوفًا وَاتَّبِعْ سَبِيلَ مَنْ أَنَابَ إِلَيَّ ثُمَّ إِلَيَّ مَرْجِعُكُمْ فَأُنَبِّئُكُم بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَعْمَلُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Eğer onlar bilmediğin şeyi bana ortak koşman için seni zorlarlarsa; sen sakın onlara itaat etme! Bununla beraber dünyada onlarla iyi geçin ve sen bana dönenlerin yoluna uy. Sonra dönüşünüz yine banadır. Ben de size yaptıklarınızı haber vereceğim.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فلهذا لم يجز أن يطاع مخلوق في معصية الخالق،<cite>«الحسنة والسيئة» 1/98</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s31a15\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/31-6.html\">Önceki âyet (31:6)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/31-18.html\">Sonraki âyet (31:18)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/31-18.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Luqman 31:18 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"İnsanlara yüzünü çevirme ve yeryüzünde böbürlenerek yürüme. Çünkü Allah kendini beğenip böbürlenen hiçbir kimseyi sevmez.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-18.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Luqman 31:18 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"İnsanlara yüzünü çevirme ve yeryüzünde böbürlenerek yürüme. Çünkü Allah kendini beğenip böbürlenen hiçbir kimseyi sevmez.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/31.html\">Sûre Luqman</a> › Âyet 18</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Luqman 31:18</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَا تُصَعِّرْ خَدَّكَ لِلنَّاسِ وَلَا تَمْشِ فِي الْأَرْضِ مَرَحًا إِنَّ اللَّهَ لَا يُحِبُّ كُلَّ مُخْتَالٍ فَخُورٍ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">İnsanlara yüzünü çevirme ve yeryüzünde böbürlenerek yürüme. Çünkü Allah kendini beğenip böbürlenen hiçbir kimseyi sevmez.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالفخر يشبه غمط الناس فإن كليهما تكبر على الناس.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 14/220</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وأما بطر الحق - وهو جحده ودفعه - فيشبه الاختيال الباطل فإنه تخيل أن الحق باطل بجحده ودفعه.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 14/220</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s31a18\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/31-15.html\">Önceki âyet (31:15)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/31-21.html\">Sonraki âyet (31:21)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/31-21.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Luqman 31:21 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Kendilerine; “Allah’ın indirdiğine tabi olun!” denildiği zaman, “Hayır, biz babalarımızı üzerinde bulduğumuz şeye uyarız.” derler. Şeytan, kendilerini Cehe\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-21.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Luqman 31:21 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Kendilerine; “Allah’ın indirdiğine tabi olun!” denildiği zaman, “Hayır, biz babalarımızı üzerinde bulduğumuz şeye uyarız.” derler. Şeytan, kendilerini Cehe\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/31.html\">Sûre Luqman</a> › Âyet 21</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Luqman 31:21</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمُ اتَّبِعُوا مَا أَنزَلَ اللَّهُ قَالُوا بَلْ نَتَّبِعُ مَا وَجَدْنَا عَلَيْهِ آبَاءَنَا أَوَلَوْ كَانَ الشَّيْطَانُ يَدْعُوهُمْ إِلَىٰ عَذَابِ السَّعِيرِ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Kendilerine; “Allah’ın indirdiğine tabi olun!” denildiği zaman, “Hayır, biz babalarımızı üzerinde bulduğumuz şeye uyarız.” derler. Şeytan, kendilerini Cehennem azabına çağırıyor olsa da mı?</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>İmam İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهذه مناظرة حكاها الله بين المسلمين والكفار فإن الكفار لجأوا إلى تقليد الآباء وظنوا أنه منجيهم لإحسانهم ظنهم بهم<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 4/173</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s31a21\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/31-18.html\">Önceki âyet (31:18)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/31-25.html\">Sonraki âyet (31:25)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/31-25.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Luqman 31:25 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Andolsun ki, onlara: &quot;Gökleri ve yeri kim yarattı?&quot; diye sorsan muhakkak: &quot;Allah&quot; diyeceklerdir.De ki: &quot;Hamt Allah&#x27;adır.&quot; Hayır, onların çoğu bilmiyorlar.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-25.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Luqman 31:25 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Andolsun ki, onlara: &quot;Gökleri ve yeri kim yarattı?&quot; diye sorsan muhakkak: &quot;Allah&quot; diyeceklerdir.De ki: &quot;Hamt Allah&#x27;adır.&quot; Hayır, onların çoğu bilmiyorlar.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/31.html\">Sûre Luqman</a> › Âyet 25</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Luqman 31:25</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَئِن سَأَلْتَهُم مَّنْ خَلَقَ السَّمَاوَاتِ وَالْأَرْضَ لَيَقُولُنَّ اللَّهُ قُلِ الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ بَلْ أَكْثَرُهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Andolsun ki, onlara: &quot;Gökleri ve yeri kim yarattı?&quot; diye sorsan muhakkak: &quot;Allah&quot; diyeceklerdir.De ki: &quot;Hamt Allah&#x27;adır.&quot; Hayır, onların çoğu bilmiyorlar.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">كانوا يقرون بأن الله خالق كل شيء وربه ومليكه؛ كما أخبر الله عنهم في القرآن في غير موضع<cite>«الاستغاثة في الرد على البكري» 1/158</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>İmam İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولهذا يحتج عليهم به على توحيد إلهيته<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 1/96</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهو توحيد الربوبية الذي اعترف به مشركو العرب، ولم يخرجوا به عن الشرك،<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 1/96</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s31a25\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/31-21.html\">Önceki âyet (31:21)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/31-27.html\">Sonraki âyet (31:27)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/31-27.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Luqman 31:27 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Eğer yeryüzündeki ağaçlar kalem, deniz de mürekkep olsa, arkasından yedi deniz daha ona katılsa, Allah’ın sözleri (yazmakla) yine de tükenmez. Muhakkak All\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-27.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Luqman 31:27 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Eğer yeryüzündeki ağaçlar kalem, deniz de mürekkep olsa, arkasından yedi deniz daha ona katılsa, Allah’ın sözleri (yazmakla) yine de tükenmez. Muhakkak All\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/31.html\">Sûre Luqman</a> › Âyet 27</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Luqman 31:27</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَوْ أَنَّمَا فِي الْأَرْضِ مِن شَجَرَةٍ أَقْلَامٌ وَالْبَحْرُ يَمُدُّهُ مِن بَعْدِهِ سَبْعَةُ أَبْحُرٍ مَّا نَفِدَتْ كَلِمَاتُ اللَّهِ إِنَّ اللَّهَ عَزِيزٌ حَكِيمٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Eğer yeryüzündeki ağaçlar kalem, deniz de mürekkep olsa, arkasından yedi deniz daha ona katılsa, Allah’ın sözleri (yazmakla) yine de tükenmez. Muhakkak Allah Azîzdir, Hakîmdir.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالأبحر إذا قدرت مدادا تنفد وكلمات الله لا تنفد؛ ولهذا قال أئمة السنة لم يزل الله متكلما كيف شاء وبما شاء<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 12/304</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>İmam İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فاخبر عن عدم نفاد كلماته لعزته وحكمته وهذان وصفان ذاتيان له سبحانه وتعالى<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/351</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإن الآية سيقت لبيان أن أشجار الأرض لو كانت أقلاما والبحار مدادا فكتبت بها كلمات الله لنفدت البحار والأقلام ولم تنفد كلمات الله<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 1/57</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإذا كانت الملازمة ثابتة على هذا التقدير الذي هو أبلغ تقدير يكون في نفاد المكتوب فثبوتها على غيره من التقادير أولى<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 1/57</cite></blockquote><h3>Başkalarından naklettikleri</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الربيع بن أنس</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «وذكر ابن أبي حاتم في تفسيره عن سليمان بن عامر قال سمعت الربيع بن أنس يقول إن مثل علم العباد كلهم في علم الله عز وجل كقطرة من هذه البحور كلها»<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/351</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s31a27\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/31-25.html\">Önceki âyet (31:25)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/31-32.html\">Sonraki âyet (31:32)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/31-32.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Luqman 31:32 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Onları dağlar gibi bir dalga kapladığında dinlerini yalnız Allah’a halis kılarak O&#x27;na dua ederler. Allah; onları kurtarıp karaya çıkarınca, onlardan bir kı\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-32.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Luqman 31:32 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Onları dağlar gibi bir dalga kapladığında dinlerini yalnız Allah’a halis kılarak O&#x27;na dua ederler. Allah; onları kurtarıp karaya çıkarınca, onlardan bir kı\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/31.html\">Sûre Luqman</a> › Âyet 32</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Luqman 31:32</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَإِذَا غَشِيَهُم مَّوْجٌ كَالظُّلَلِ دَعَوُا اللَّهَ مُخْلِصِينَ لَهُ الدِّينَ فَلَمَّا نَجَّاهُمْ إِلَى الْبَرِّ فَمِنْهُم مُّقْتَصِدٌ وَمَا يَجْحَدُ بِآيَاتِنَا إِلَّا كُلُّ خَتَّارٍ كَفُورٍ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Onları dağlar gibi bir dalga kapladığında dinlerini yalnız Allah’a halis kılarak O&#x27;na dua ederler. Allah; onları kurtarıp karaya çıkarınca, onlardan bir kısmı orta yolu tutar. Ayetlerimizi hain ve çokça nankörlük edenden başkası bilerek inkâr etmez.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأخبر أنهم مقرون بربوبيته، وأنهم مخلصون له الدين إذا مسهم الضر في دعائهم واستعانتهم،<cite>«قاعدة جامعة في توحيد الله وإخلاص الوجه والعمل له عبادة واستعانة» 1/68</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s31a32\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/31-27.html\">Önceki âyet (31:27)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/31-34.html\">Sonraki âyet (31:34)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/31-34.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Luqman 31:34 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Kıyametin ne zaman kopacağı bilgisi şüphesiz yalnızca Allah katındadır. O; yağmuru indirir, rahimlerdekini bilir. Hiç kimse yarın ne kazanacağını bilemez. \">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/31-34.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Luqman 31:34 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Kıyametin ne zaman kopacağı bilgisi şüphesiz yalnızca Allah katındadır. O; yağmuru indirir, rahimlerdekini bilir. Hiç kimse yarın ne kazanacağını bilemez. \">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/31.html\">Sûre Luqman</a> › Âyet 34</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Luqman 31:34</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِنَّ اللَّهَ عِندَهُ عِلْمُ السَّاعَةِ وَيُنَزِّلُ الْغَيْثَ وَيَعْلَمُ مَا فِي الْأَرْحَامِ وَمَا تَدْرِي نَفْسٌ مَّاذَا تَكْسِبُ غَدًا وَمَا تَدْرِي نَفْسٌ بِأَيِّ أَرْضٍ تَمُوتُ إِنَّ اللَّهَ عَلِيمٌ خَبِيرٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Kıyametin ne zaman kopacağı bilgisi şüphesiz yalnızca Allah katındadır. O; yağmuru indirir, rahimlerdekini bilir. Hiç kimse yarın ne kazanacağını bilemez. Hiç kimse nerede öleceğini de bilemez. Şüphesiz Allah hakkıyla bilendir, (her şeyden) hakkıyla haberdar olandır.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالساعة هنا: معلومة، لا عالمة،<cite>«الحسنة والسيئة» 1/137</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s31a34\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/31-32.html\">Önceki âyet (31:32)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","surah/31.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Sûre Luqman — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tefsiri: Sûre Luqman — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;in sözleriyle Kur&#x27;an&#x27;ın manaları\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/31.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/surah/31.html\">\n<link rel=\"